What this patch adds:
A new monster: the roardrunner
        This monster is like a super fast yellow mold, except it flees all
        the time. The Rougue's attack bonus is removed. The attack bonus
        because although it's fleeing all the time, it should be considered
        expert in running-away.
        It was added to the bat class on account of the raven being in those
        too. I ment it to have an occurence probability somewhere between a
        tengu and a gray dragon.
        Upon eating you start halucinating. This was unintentional, but
        seems to be automatic for monsters you stun you on contact. I found
        a rational for this: Since the (animated series) original roadrunner
        never gets eaten, who knows what happens when you do? :) Not the
        best reason, so I might remove this in the future.
A new object: roadrunner feathers
        A set of these can be attached to the two leather non magical of
        boots, turning them into feathered boots.
A new object: feathered boots
        These grant "You are fast" speed. They can be transformed into
        speed boots by means of a scroll of enchant armor.


